Z||000000||fierohoho||11-20-2001||06:07 AM||||I was out patroling tonight and was about a block outside the city limits and decided to cruise behind a business and see what was there, I round the corner and there sits a 1988 Red Formula. <P>I get out and look at it, 40,00 miles 2.8L 5-speed. <P>No power anything and no sunroof. <P>The only thing wrong I see is no air dam under the aero nose and the drivers mirror looks like it caught on somthing and got bent to s**t along with the top edge of the door. <P>It has a factory wing also.<P>It has 1999 license tabs so it's sat for a couple years.<P>I'm going to go back when they're open to see whats up with it, hope they don't know what they have.<P>Wish me luck, I'll let ya know what I find out tonight.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>'84 SE 2.5l<BR>'85 Coupe 2.5l now getting a 3800<BR>'86 SE 2.5l<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lightbar.gif"> ||||reg||14
